    "name": "Shampoo Bar-  Lemongrass",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Our shampoo bars are gentle, soft, &amp; moisturizing.&nbsp;Plus, the ingredients are completely natural! Made with saponified coconut, palm, olive, canola, neem, &amp; castor oils, rain water, &amp; lemongrass essential oil.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Attention naturalists, backpackers, and campers! Here is a great biodegradable, earth-friendly &amp; sustainable choice for you: our&nbsp;all-natural SHAMPOO BAR. It's shampoo in a bar form!</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">We only use biodegradable shrink wrap on our soaps.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Biolefin is formulated to be totally degradable in the environment. At the end of its useful life, it fragments and oxidizes by the effect of light and heat. It then becomes assimilable by s o i l m i c r o - o r g a n i s m s , a n d eventually disappears, leaving only water, carbon dioxide and biomass.</span></p>",
